  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, the craven can pay for immense power to be added to his weapon. The craven can pay gold equal to his craven level to add his craven level as a competence bonus to a single damage roll. However, he may choose to pay less than his craven level to deal bonus damage equal to the amount spent. He may sacrifice currency from any part of his person with a thought as part of the attack action. This gold can be paid after the attack roll but before the damage roll. The craven may not benefit from this more than once per round. If this ability is prevented from working (if he is in an antimagic field, for example), he cannot sacrifice the coins. The craven may use this ability a number of times per day equal to his Intelligence modifier + 1/2 his craven level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-craven#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
